django-modern-rest 0.16.0 is out! Is this your first time that you hear about this project?
django-modern-rest is a fully typed / fast / flexible / async-ready framework to create REST APIs for Django. It supports Pydantic, msgspec, attrs and many other models. Here's how the code looks like: import uuid
    import pydantic
    from dmr import Body, Controller
    from dmr.plugins.pydantic import PydanticFastSerializer

    class UserCreateModel(pydantic.BaseModel):
        email: str

    class UserModel(UserCreateModel):
        uid: uuid.UUID

    class UserController(Controller[PydanticFastSerializer]):
        def post(self, parsed_body: Body[UserCreateModel]) -> UserModel:
            return UserModel(uid=uuid.uuid4(), email=parsed_body.email) Other notable features: - Builtin auth with sessions / JWT headers and cookies - Validation of requests and responses according to the OpenAPI spec in debug mode, the spec is the source of truth - Builtin content negotiation, supporting con
